  "description": "Three years ago, a poisoning murder occurred in a luxury apartment. Hwa-Young, who lost her mother in this incident, begins collecting a large sum of money to find the culprit. Believed to make a fortune, she engages in a crime known as \"fishing,\" but soon realizes she's the target of human trafficking... As she struggles to escape, \"If you're going to run, take me with you.\" \"Smile Bear,\" filled with memories of her mother, appears, wielding a blood-dripping hatchet.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
